# Docker / release

- Static nginx image serving Vite `dist/`; Coolify-ready on port 80.
- Never commit `.env` secrets; only `.env.example`.
- Release via `workflow_dispatch`: bump semver → commit `package.json` → branch `release/X.Y.Z` → tag `vX.Y.Z` → push GHCR.
- Honor `STRIP_SOURCE_MAPS`: when true, final image must contain no `*.map`.
- Inject `VITE_APP_VERSION` / `VITE_IMAGE_VERSION` at build for the footer.
